n_US<br>Note: Continued use of GPS running can dramatically decrease battery life. Your location data also may be used in our analytics.<br><br>Find top local businesses, restaurants, bars, hotels, events, and other things to do around you, read customer reviews, order food or food pick up, and search for home services near me, all from the Yelp app.",
